{
  "_comment": [
    "Seed respawn catalogue for the /respawn claim system.",
    "Imported into a guild's `respawns` table on first use (and re-importable via",
    "`/respawn admin seed`, which only ever ADDS codes the guild doesn't have yet —",
    "it never overwrites a guild's own edits).",
    "",
    "`creature` is the main monster of the spawn and drives the claim embed's image",
    "via presentation.Urls.creatureImageUrl (the tibiawiki.com.br redirect). It is",
    "deliberately left empty wherever the spawn name doesn't name a creature",
    "unambiguously — a blank field renders the fallback image, whereas a wrong guess",
    "renders a confidently wrong monster. Fill them in over time with",
    "`/respawn admin edit <code> creature:<name>` or by editing this file.",
    "",
    "Names that need a non-obvious wiki file name are handled by mappings.conf's",
    "creature-url-mappings, same as the boosted-creature lookups."
  ],
